WEBVTT

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:31.640
This morning we've heard a lot of whispers
about Tom O'Reilly's wrap-up on Saturday.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.000
Einstein, did you hear whispers?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.000
E: [Squawks]

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.000
SW: Yeah.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
(Laughter)

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.900
Einstein's especially interested 
in Penelope's talk.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.971
A lot of her research goes on in case, 
which can get pretty dusty.

00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:44.000
E: Achoo!

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.560
SW: It could make her sneeze.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.950
But more importantly, 
her research could help Einstein

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.671
find a cure for her 
never-ending scratchy throat.

00:00:50.671 --> 00:00:51.790
Einstein: [Coughs]

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.000
SW: Yeah.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:53.770
(Laughter)

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:56.700
Well, Bob Russell was telling us 
about his work on nanotubes

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.990
in his research at the microscopic level.

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:02.000
Well, that's really cool, 
but what Einstein's really hoping